  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h1> The Modular Premium Class </h1>",
   "body": "<p class=\"large-text\"><strong>They are the best you can bring onto your team: the premium »venturion« presetting and measuring machines. </strong></p> <p class=\"large-text\">The robust main body is made of a light-metal alloy that was developed in a specialized manner for measuring machines. Exclusively high-quality brand-name components are used, and the workmanship of »a« »venturion« is outstanding. These precision instruments can easily withstand the toughest conditions in any configuration and with any optional extension—even on the production floor of an industrial manufacturing facility.</p>",
   "images": [
